description	"Ithorian Environmentialist

Multi-Life Healing Specialists, prefers to look after their team.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
-- 15% Faster Movement
-- 15% Slower Swings
- Vibrosaber
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- 15% faster Movement
- Kolto Grenades (4)
-- Conc Grenades, Heal, 0 Damage

^8Attributes:
- Ithorian Strength
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (0)
- Blast Armor
- Assemble (2)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"